

  Hello world!!!!!


=+ About us +=

We provide the latest (near-)mainline Linux for the good old MediaTek MT6589 (MT8125/MT8389).
Also porting postmarketOS to Lenovo YOGA Tablet 8/10 (`lenovo-blade`).
It is an unofficial successor to TeamYogaBlade.
respect: https://github.com/TeamYogaBlade


=+ Projects +=

-------
 Linux
-------
main work.

https://github.com/TeamYogaBlade2/linux


-----------------
 U-Boot (halted)
-----------------
FLOSS bootloader for MT6589.

https://github.com/TeamYogaBlade2/u-boot


-------------------
 Barebox (not yet)
-------------------
Re: FLOSS bootloader for MT6589.

https://github.com/TeamYogaBlade2/barebox


------
 note
------
porting notes and scripts

https://github.com/TeamYogaBlade2/note/wiki


--------------
 postmarketOS
--------------
almost broken yet.
currently no plans to send MR upstream for practicality and compliance reasons.

https://wiki.postmarketos.org/wiki/Lenovo_YOGA_Tablet_8/10_(lenovo-blade)
https://github.com/TeamYogaBlade2/lenovo-b8000_postmarketos_files


---------
 PrismRV
---------
PowerVR SGX (544) reversing.
The project name is from "Prismriver Sisters" (Touhou Project).

https://github.com/TeamYogaBlade2/PrismRV
https://github.com/TeamYogaBlade2/mesa


-------------------------
 Downstream kernel (new)
-------------------------
Lenovo released fake source code,
so we build a new downstream kernel based on bq/aquaris-5.

https://github.com/TeamYogaBlade2/android_kernel_lenovo_b8000-new


-----------------------------
 Downstream kernel reversing
-----------------------------
Lenovo does not provide real kernel source code,
so some drivers require reverse engineering.

panel: https://github.com/TeamYogaBlade2/android_kernel_lenovo_b8000-jellybean_osc/issues/1
ProjectConfig.mk: https://gist.github.com/akku1139/ad961f42623679f5d86335a052ea1975


